**/cache/*.log
!**/cache/.gitkeep
*.parquet
*.geojson

# Lane B handoff bundle: 78 MB of generated data for teammates, not source.
handoff/

# --- committed so a fresh clone behaves exactly like a dev machine ---------
# The exposure table and shadow overlays are generated, but regenerating them
# needs a ~3 minute pipeline run against Overpass, a free public API whose
# latency we measured anywhere from 5 seconds to a hard timeout. 22 MB in the
# repo is a fair trade for `git clone` producing a working app.
# The raw OSM/tree pickles stay out: large, regenerable, and only needed to
# re-run the pipeline itself.
!backend/cache/segments.parquet
!backend/cache/shadows_*.geojson
